<title>UK: London gold fixes slightly easier, little business.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes slightly easier, little business.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $341.60 vs $342.05 AM. Drifted off slightly with New York. Not much business and seen contained within tight range.</p>
<p>SILVER - Back to early Wednesday levels at $4.72/$4.74. Funds sold previous afternoon's positions on Comex.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Easier from AM at $407.00/$412.00 down $10.00</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also easier at $188.50/$193.50 down $6.50.</p>
</text>
